WEBVTT

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:05.950
<i>Men are horrible. Things to be feared.</i>

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.320
<i>But, why is it?</i>

00:00:31.770 --> 00:00:34.280
<i>Why is my heart beating so fast?!</i>

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:40.510
<b>Dog</b>

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:40.510
<b>A
k
a
n
e

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:42.100
I'm sorry, Sensei!

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:46.940
<b>Men Are Dangerous</b>

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:45.310
What's up?

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:47.020
<b>Team
Dog</b>

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:47.020
What's going on?

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:48.560
Did something happen?

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:50.020
It's Sazanka and Asagao.

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:52.040
Word is, they're missing.

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:53.620
Again?

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:56.410
I suspect they went outside.

00:00:56.650 --> 00:00:57.790
Is it a desertion?

00:00:57.790 --> 00:00:59.690
Goofing off, more like.

00:00:59.690 --> 00:01:03.250
As the leader of Akane Class's Team Dog,

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:05.000
<b>Asagao              Sazanka             Tsubaki</b>

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:05.000
how will you take 
responsibility for this situation?

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:07.100
I'll bring them back at once!

00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:09.880
Wonderful...

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:12.250
And tonight, of all times...

00:01:12.740 --> 00:01:15.790
Sensei, is something happening tonight?

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:20.250
Aoi Class has a nighttime lesson.

00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:21.340
No way!

00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:22.440
Aoi Class?

00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:22.990
That means they're nearby?

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:25.490
Aoi Class, she said!

00:01:25.490 --> 00:01:29.060
You mean the filthy men on the 
other side of the mountains?

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:31.920
I hear men are incredibly stupid!

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:34.640
Seems they have big bodies, 
but small brains!

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:36.420
They're just like monkeys, right?

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:39.760
From what I hear, they're kinda stinky!

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.850
That's so weird!

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:45.830
Yuck, don't they ever take baths?

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:46.910
Team
Dog

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:49.880
Also, also, their crotch is 
their weak spot. Frail fail!

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:53.210
Fools!

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:56.220
Don't take men lightly!

00:01:57.420 --> 00:01:59.050
Don't I always tell you?

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:02.630
They're strong, and highly barbarous!

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:04.680
Underestimate them at your peril!

00:02:08.180 --> 00:02:10.990
Well, so long as you get it.

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:14.250
Can two or three of you go with her?

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:15.610
Sensei.

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:18.980
Is it all right if I go alone?

00:02:18.980 --> 00:02:24.060
I'd... feel bad about inconveniencing 
girls from other teams.

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:27.340
I guess you can manage on your own.

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:31.490
They're all scared of men, anyway.

00:02:31.490 --> 00:02:34.880
It might be that they're scared of you.

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:40.520
I leave it to you, then.

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:41.220
Yes, ma'am!

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:47.390
I, Akane Class kunoichi Tsubaki, will be 
sure to return with Sazanka and Asagao!

00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:48.580
Mhm.

00:02:52.170 --> 00:02:55.640
Be sure not to let those two near any men.

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:56.850
You hear?

00:02:56.850 --> 00:02:57.360
Yes, ma'am!

00:02:58.320 --> 00:02:59.640
I shall return!

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:09.790
I just hope nothing happens.

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:14.460
<i>Men are up in the mountains.</i>

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:24.800
<i>M-Men are...</i>

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:26.510
<i>Stop that!</i>

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:29.710
<i>Sazanka, Asagao...</i>

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:36.400
Hey, Sazanka.

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:38.190
Let's just go home!

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:39.940
What are you talking about, Asagao?

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:43.620
We're going to show Nee-sama 
what we can do. Look alive!

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:48.620
I can't. I'm too tired. And I'm hungry.

00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:56.480
You know, sleepiness and 
hunger are your downfall.

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:58.980
Can't take any more...

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:02.540
Have it your way. 
Let's find some mushrooms.

00:04:04.030 --> 00:04:05.140
Asagao?!

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:08.890
What're you doing? Pull yourself together.

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:11.800
Hey, this is no time for...

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:15.270
Asagao?

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:19.070
Hey, are you o—

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:24.910
L-Looks like that woke you up.

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:29.370
Hey, what are we doing again?

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:32.290
Huh? Did you hit your head?

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:36.330
We're searching for men.

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:38.160
Now do you remember?

00:04:39.740 --> 00:04:43.880
Huh. And so, you slipped out 
in the middle of the night.

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:47.090
You're a bad girl, Sazanka.

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:49.600
N-N-

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:52.970
Nee-sama!

00:04:52.970 --> 00:04:54.880
I'm here to catch you, Sazanka.

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:55.730
Oh...

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:58.510
This is such a habit, I just...

00:04:58.510 --> 00:05:00.190
You are too much.

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:01.900
So...

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:06.430
How is it you know there are 
men up in the mountains?

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:09.470
I heard the teachers talking.

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:13.660
Was that when you were off playing hooky?

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:15.060
I swear...

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:16.040
It's not like that!

00:05:16.730 --> 00:05:20.150
I was picking flowers to give to you.

00:05:20.150 --> 00:05:23.710
That's when... I happened to overhear it.

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:29.180
And so, what did you intend to do?

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:32.390
Could it be, you were...

00:05:32.800 --> 00:05:35.930
Yes, of course! 
I was going to beat them up!

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:38.160
Men are the enemy of women!

00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:42.460
I'm not about to let this chance 
slip away when they're so close!

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:45.240
We're leaving.

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:46.320
Huh?!

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:48.700
Sensei was livid.

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:54.020
You even dragged Asagao into this. 
You're such a bad girl, Sazanka.

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:57.750
I'm sorry, Nee-sama!

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:04.670
I thought I could get you to 
praise me if I defeated the men.

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:06.050
That's why...

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:12.430
I'm glad you're all right.

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:14.710
Now, let's go home.

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:18.940
Huh?

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:22.270
Sazanka! Were those more crocodile tears?!

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:24.480
No need to worry, Nee-sama.

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:28.360
Those men will all fall before my might.

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:30.660
You can praise me later!

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:30.660
Stop right there!

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:35.150
Sazanka!

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:41.380
Bad girl!

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:44.630
Was that a good idea?

00:06:44.910 --> 00:06:46.750
Tricking Tsubaki-chan.

00:06:47.730 --> 00:06:49.840
She came to get us.

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:53.690
If we go home right now, 
Sensei will just let us have it.

00:06:53.690 --> 00:06:57.220
If we defeat the men, 
I'm sure Nee-sama will praise us, too.

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:58.820
I'm not so sure.

00:06:58.160 --> 00:06:59.640
Sazanka! Asagao!

00:06:59.990 --> 00:07:01.050
Tsubaki-chan?!

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:02.350
She caught up already?!

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:05.860
You bad girls are coming 
home if I have to drag you!

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:08.120
See?! She's mad!

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:09.440
We'll give her the slip!

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:11.740
I don't think it'll work!

00:07:29.620 --> 00:07:30.860
Asagao!

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:52.050
Let's go home.

00:07:52.050 --> 00:07:53.160
Yes, ma'am.

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:56.400
There'll be punishment when we get back.

00:07:56.400 --> 00:07:57.580
Yes, ma'am.

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:00.470
It'll probably mean going 
without food tomorrow.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:04.000
That's too much! It'll kill me!

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:07.330
I just got brought along, that's all!

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:08.960
It's a shared responsibility.

00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:11.600
All three of us will be punished.

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:13.180
Even you?

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:20.000
Food!

00:08:21.590 --> 00:08:23.320
Listen, you two.

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:25.900
If you've learned your lesson, 
start following the rules and—

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:36.210
The sounds of kunai...

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:39.620
It must be the men, Nee-sama. 
Let's go over there!

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:40.520
<i>Men are...</i>

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:42.330
This is our chance to stand out!

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:45.880
<i>Men are... close by!</i>

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:47.960
We can get out of being punished!

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:51.230
You really want to beat up 
the men, too, don't you?!

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:56.640
I want to see for myself.

00:08:57.640 --> 00:08:58.700
You want to "see"?

00:08:59.590 --> 00:09:00.240
Uh, no...!

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:04.430
I get it! You can't come out and say it 
in your position, so you're being vague!

00:09:04.430 --> 00:09:06.440
Wrong! Please forget about it!

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:07.330
Huh?!

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:08.430
Let's go home!

00:09:09.680 --> 00:09:12.180
<i>I let slip what I really think...</i>

00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:14.160
Let's go check it out!

00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:15.710
No!

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:21.350
<i>Men are stupid, simple, 
loud, dirty, and foolish.</i>

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:23.540
<i>But we must never take them lightly.</i>

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:25.750
<i>We mustn't go near them.</i>

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:28.920
<i>That's what we've always been taught.</i>

00:09:29.850 --> 00:09:31.210
<i>So, why is it?</i>

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:39.470
<i>Lately, a desire to learn about 
men has been growing in my heart!</i>

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:42.890
<i>My face feels hot, too.</i>

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:45.720
<i>Is there something wrong with me?</i>

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:48.220
How about this?! We'll just spy on them!

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:51.620
Spy?

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:53.820
That's right! We'll just watch!

00:09:54.530 --> 00:10:00.600
T-True, it might prove useful 
to confirm what they look like.

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:01.390
Yippee!

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:03.120
<i>What am I saying?!</i>

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:04.680
Let's do this, Asagao.

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:07.000
Do what? Aren't we just looking?

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:10.540
No, dummy! Nee-sama actually 
wants us to beat them up.

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:15.090
<i>No, don't do this! Haven't I always 
followed the straight and narrow?!</i>

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:16.740
Let's go!

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:21.570
We're just going to look. That's final.

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:22.800
But of course!

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:28.320
<i>Oh, God. Please forgive me.</i>

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:32.110
<i>I'll just look. 
And then I'll go straight home!</i>

00:10:34.140 --> 00:10:35.190
<i>Up ahead...</i>

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:37.410
<i>there are men...</i>

00:10:44.930 --> 00:10:46.260
Is someone there?

00:10:58.340 --> 00:11:01.670
Hey, Nee-sama! Why did we run?!

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:05.240
Scouting was a no-go, too!

00:11:05.240 --> 00:11:07.930
Let's go back there and kick some butt!

00:11:07.930 --> 00:11:11.280
"Kick"?! Were you even listening to me?!

00:11:11.280 --> 00:11:12.530
Bad girl!

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:20.240
Um, are you, by any chance...

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:22.490
a man?

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:26.330
Just a moment, please!

00:11:26.960 --> 00:11:29.260
Let me have a look!

00:11:34.150 --> 00:11:36.500
Good morning, Nee-sama.

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:38.930
It was a dream?

00:11:38.930 --> 00:11:42.050
It's unusual for you to oversleep.

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:42.880
Oversleep?!

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:45.800
It's not so late that you need to panic.

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:47.780
Oversleeping is oversleeping.

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:49.700
Nee-sama?

00:11:50.760 --> 00:11:54.020
Did last night's punishment 
affect you that badly?

00:11:56.670 --> 00:11:59.160
No, I simply overslept.

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:01.740
<b>Dining
Hall</b>

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:04.200
Gimme more! Make it a huge helping!

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:04.200
Asagao

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:06.220
How much do you eat, anyway?

00:12:06.220 --> 00:12:08.360
Rice is yummy!

00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:09.460
Asagao.

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:11.910
Good morning.

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:13.910
You're eating a lot, as always.

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:15.750
Morning, Tsubaki-chan.

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:18.790
I was really hungry, thanks to Sazanka.

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:21.850
Huh? What're you talking about, dumb Asagao?

00:12:21.850 --> 00:12:23.220
You always eat a ton.

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:24.770
You overeater.

00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:27.380
Nah, I don't overeat.

00:12:27.380 --> 00:12:29.810
Look at how much I've grown.

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:33.210
If <i>you</i> don't eat more, 
you won't get any taller.

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:33.940
Huh?!

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:34.900
Cut that out.

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:35.960
What did you say?!

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:36.950
It's the truth!

00:12:36.950 --> 00:12:38.700
Hearing it from your stupid mouth irks me!

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:40.860
The one who says "stupid" is the stupid one!

00:12:40.170 --> 00:12:42.440
Shut up! Take a seat first!

00:12:42.680 --> 00:12:45.030
Let's hurry and eat.

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:46.820
Tsubaki

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:48.780
Thank you for the food.

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:51.620
Want to do afternoon team 
activities together?

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:53.880
I'm teaching my girls how to use kunai.

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:56.040
That sounds good. I'll join you.

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:59.250
Your chopsticks stopped moving again. 
Eat properly.

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:03.470
This fish is delicious.

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:04.920
Yes, Nee-sama.

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:06.680
Thank goodness, Asagao.

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:09.400
We didn't have to go without breakfast.

00:13:09.400 --> 00:13:11.720
It's thanks to my fake crying!

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:14.680
What part of that was fake? 
It was shameful.

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:19.980
"I want to eat! 
Please forgive me, Sensei!"

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:21.990
It wasn't like that!

00:13:21.990 --> 00:13:24.130
And wasn't it all your 
fault in the first place?!

00:13:24.130 --> 00:13:26.860
Would've worked if you 
weren't slow in the head.

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:27.440
Let's just eat in peace.

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:29.070
For the record, "Huh?!"

00:13:27.440 --> 00:13:29.070
Hey, Tsubaki.

00:13:29.400 --> 00:13:31.820
Benisumomo. Good morning.

00:13:31.820 --> 00:13:34.990
You went looking for men 
in the mountains yesterday?

00:13:34.990 --> 00:13:36.430
Fill me in on the details.

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:37.320
I want to hear them, too!

00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:38.360
So do I!

00:13:38.360 --> 00:13:40.000
I'm curious, too!

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:41.690
Tell us! Tell us!

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:42.750
So...

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:44.210
Did you see them?

00:13:44.560 --> 00:13:47.470
Huh? Oh, no, it was dark.

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:49.180
I only heard voices.

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:50.800
You didn't get a good look?

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:51.480
Well, then.

00:13:51.480 --> 00:13:53.210
Boring.

00:13:53.210 --> 00:13:55.050
Don't tell me you girls are...

00:13:55.880 --> 00:13:58.340
interested in men?

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:00.730
They definitely stink.

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:02.450
I hear they don't take baths.

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:03.360
Is that so?

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:05.320
I wonder how dumb they are.

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:07.060
Could you hit them, and they wouldn't notice?

00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:08.070
<i>That</i> dumb?

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:12.120
Also, also, they've got big bodies, 
but a weak crotch.

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:14.200
I hear you can take 'em down in an instant!

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:16.380
<i>Maybe there </i>is<i> something wrong with me.</i>

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:15.360
What's with that?

00:14:15.360 --> 00:14:17.000
Talk about weird.

00:14:19.760 --> 00:14:20.500
Wait for me!

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:21.840
Hey!

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:24.130
We don't play with the laundry!

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:28.590
<b>Men</b>

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:28.590
For a ninja, there is a mental 
rule of paramount importance.

00:14:29.240 --> 00:14:30.170
Namely...

00:14:30.170 --> 00:14:31.260
<i>"Men."</i>

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:32.430
imperturbability.

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:36.330
<i>The way it's written gives an 
impression of something firm,</i>

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:38.520
At all times, you must endeavor to 
be capable of making calm deci...

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:38.520
<i>and sort of thick and hard...</i>

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:39.440
Tsubaki.

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:42.440
<i>Could actual men be that way?</i>

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:42.440
Hey.

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:44.070
Tsubaki.

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:45.580
On your feet, Tsubaki!

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:46.280
Yes, ma'am!

00:14:49.550 --> 00:14:53.440
It's rare for you not to be listening.

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:55.120
S-Sorry, ma'am.

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:58.710
Team Dog already has two 
problem children as it is.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.450
You need to keep a level head.

00:15:01.450 --> 00:15:02.630
Yes, ma'am...

00:15:03.030 --> 00:15:06.720
Right. Be sure to focus your 
strength in your abdomen.

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:09.590
<b>Strength in one's abdomen</b>

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:09.590
<b>Strength in one's abdomen</b>

00:15:07.850 --> 00:15:09.590
<i>Strength in my abdo—"men"?</i>

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:12.930
<b>Men</b>

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:12.930
<b>Men</b>

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:12.080
<i>"Men"!</i>

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:12.930
Tsubaki.

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:16.430
What's wrong? You can sit down now.

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:18.180
Y-Yes, ma'am.

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:21.940
On our last day off, you know?

00:15:22.530 --> 00:15:27.900
I took a walk down to the pond, and you 
know what I found there? A bird's nest.

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:30.240
They were so cute!

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:34.320
<i>I wonder if Mokuren ever 
has men on her mind.</i>

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:33.520
Let's go see them together next time.

00:15:35.570 --> 00:15:36.530
Tsubaki?

00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:40.170
What's with you today? Do you feel poorly?

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:42.640
No, it's nothing.

00:15:42.640 --> 00:15:43.380
Really?

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:44.240
Yes.

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:45.790
If you're worn out, just speak up.

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:49.460
Leave it to our Team Monkey medical experts.

00:15:51.560 --> 00:15:53.940
Thank you, Mokuren.

00:15:56.470 --> 00:15:57.760
Oh...

00:15:57.760 --> 00:15:59.060
You're trying too hard.

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:03.330
If you throw using your whole body, 
you won't need as much arm strength.

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:05.450
You know, men don't take baths, so they're 
totally stinky! Especially their feet.

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:04.480
Keep that in mind.

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:05.450
I will.

00:16:05.450 --> 00:16:07.400
Stinky? That's gross.

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:10.360
I missed you, Nee-sama.

00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:14.420
Why must our morning classes 
be in different places?

00:16:14.420 --> 00:16:16.610
Because you're not the same age, Sazanka.

00:16:16.610 --> 00:16:17.740
I know that!

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:22.460
Tsubaki-chan is an upperclassmen, 
and we're underclassmen.

00:16:20.800 --> 00:16:22.460
I already told you, I know!

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:23.750
Hear this, Team Dog!

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:26.710
Today's the day we take your team name!

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:28.250
I challenge you to a fair fight!

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:31.580
Team Monkey runt.

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:35.010
We're both nearly the same height, you runt!

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:36.090
What did you say?!

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:39.910
Stop that, Sazanka.

00:16:39.910 --> 00:16:41.640
Housenka!

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:43.020
You shouldn't do that!

00:16:43.020 --> 00:16:44.100
I'll say...

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:46.050
You'll interfere with their training.

00:16:46.050 --> 00:16:47.520
Yeah, but...!

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:50.820
This is our chance to become Team Dog!

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:53.580
"Monkey" is unsophisticated 
and I've had enough!

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:55.110
"Monkey" is not unsophisticated.

00:16:55.430 --> 00:16:59.210
Besides, beating them isn't 
going to change our team name.

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:02.190
Sorry to bother you.

00:17:02.190 --> 00:17:03.560
No problem.

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:08.850
When I mentioned you weren't feeling 
well, she went running off.

00:17:08.850 --> 00:17:09.560
Huh?

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:12.060
Well, don't overdo it!

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:19.950
Nee-sama! Let's go straight 
home and sleep together!

00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:24.530
Good idea! You shouldn't overdo it.

00:17:24.530 --> 00:17:26.270
I-I'm fine, okay?

00:17:26.910 --> 00:17:30.350
<i>I think these two just want to skip training.</i>

00:17:30.350 --> 00:17:31.690
Nee-sama.

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:34.650
Are you really all right?

00:17:37.550 --> 00:17:38.620
Just watch this.

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:49.070
Whoa! Bull's-eye on both! Amazing!

00:17:49.070 --> 00:17:50.920
True to form, Nee-sama!

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:52.960
Next up, shuriken.

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:53.630
Okay!

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:55.620
If you would, Nee-sama!

00:17:56.250 --> 00:18:01.550
<i>As team leader, I have to be 
sure not to worry these two.</i>

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:04.060
<i>I have to keep it together!</i>

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:05.740
And y'know, men...

00:18:05.740 --> 00:18:06.940
<i>Men?!</i>

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:09.360
They're huge, but they've got a weak crotch!

00:18:12.080 --> 00:18:14.980
Nee-sama! You're unwell after all!

00:18:13.700 --> 00:18:14.980
I-It's not that!

00:18:14.980 --> 00:18:17.200
My hand just slipped!

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:19.200
N-Next, I'll transform.

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:20.970
Into what?

00:18:20.970 --> 00:18:22.720
Into you, Asagao.

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:23.730
Yay!

00:18:23.730 --> 00:18:24.910
Nee-sama...

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:27.010
<i>Focus, focus.</i>

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:29.000
Are they that filthy?

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:31.580
Yeah! And they smell, too!

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:31.580
<i>Focus!</i>

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:34.040
Huh, I heard they're beatable 
if you aim for the crotch.

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:35.600
I wouldn't want to touch that.

00:18:35.600 --> 00:18:38.090
They're hopeless in so many ways, men.

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:39.050
<i>Men!</i>

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:44.300
Nee-sama...

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:46.890
No, wait! This is...

00:18:45.820 --> 00:18:46.890
So cute!

00:18:47.300 --> 00:18:48.310
U-Um, I mean...

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:49.960
So, Tsubaki-chan.

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:54.320
Haven't you been screwing up 
whenever you hear the word "men"?

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:56.070
How come?

00:18:57.360 --> 00:18:58.820
H-Hey!

00:18:58.820 --> 00:19:00.360
Let's go, Asagao.

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:02.530
Sazanka!

00:19:07.520 --> 00:19:09.720
What's the big idea?

00:19:09.720 --> 00:19:12.350
We can't have other people 
hearing this, can we?

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:13.330
Huh?

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:15.170
This is a crisis.

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:17.300
When it comes to men...

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:21.830
I can't believe Nee-sama 
might be afraid of them.

00:19:23.110 --> 00:19:26.500
Th-That's not it! It's not that I'm afraid!

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:27.840
But it's something else?

00:19:27.840 --> 00:19:29.700
Uh, no...

00:19:29.700 --> 00:19:32.100
I-It's just a coincidence, really.

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:33.480
Then, hey.

00:19:33.840 --> 00:19:36.440
Why not try an experiment?

00:19:39.140 --> 00:19:40.200
Okay, Nee-sama.

00:19:40.880 --> 00:19:45.420
Please use Fire Style Jutsu to 
evaporate this entire puddle.

00:19:45.420 --> 00:19:48.270
Normally, you'd be able to do it.

00:19:48.270 --> 00:19:53.420
However, just before you use the Jutsu, 
I'm going to whisper the word "men."

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:54.940
If you can't do it...

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:58.050
it will mean you're afraid of men.

00:19:58.050 --> 00:20:01.550
I thought it up. Isn't that great?

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:01.550
I know.

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:07.090
<i>I can't afford to make these 
girls worry any further.</i>

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:10.500
<i>Just focus, like always...</i>

00:20:11.430 --> 00:20:13.120
Anytime you're ready.

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:13.900
All right.

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:18.320
Nee-sama!

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:20.490
Wh-What are you doing, Sazanka?!

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:24.020
C-Couldn't help it! 
Next time I'll do it right!

00:20:24.020 --> 00:20:24.940
You mean that?

00:20:24.940 --> 00:20:26.660
Let's go!

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:30.620
I'm not lying!

00:20:32.010 --> 00:20:33.550
I'm counting on you.

00:20:33.550 --> 00:20:34.580
Okay!

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:41.130
M-e-n.

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:49.600
<i>Tsubaki is off her game. 
No way will I miss this chance.</i>

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:53.730
<i>I'll defeat them while I can, 
and take the name of Team Dog!</i>

00:21:04.480 --> 00:21:08.930
N-Never mind evaporation. 
You made a crater.

00:21:08.930 --> 00:21:10.800
Wow, Tsubaki-chan!

00:21:10.800 --> 00:21:14.740
Hey, Asagao! How do you figure 
she's "afraid of men"?!

00:21:14.740 --> 00:21:15.250
Huh?

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:17.200
This is more amazing than usual!

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:19.000
<i>What just happened?</i>

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:19.360
Wasn't this your idea, Sazanka?!

00:21:19.360 --> 00:21:20.800
It was kind of your idea!

00:21:20.350 --> 00:21:22.090
<i>Something </i>must<i>...</i>

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:23.050
For the record, "Huh?!"

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:24.680
Don't go telling lies!

00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:25.980
<i>...be wrong with me...</i>

00:21:24.680 --> 00:21:26.930
You're the one who's quick to lie!

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:28.890
What did you say?!

00:22:59.410 --> 00:23:02.990
Say, is it true you saw 
what a man looks like?

00:23:02.990 --> 00:23:06.360
Yeah, I saw one. I see well in the dark.

00:23:06.650 --> 00:23:08.620
Transform and show us, then.

00:23:08.620 --> 00:23:09.930
Sure thing.

00:23:11.450 --> 00:23:14.970
<i>I can't believe Asagao got a look at a man!</i>

00:23:15.400 --> 00:23:17.920
<i>This means I get to see one!</i>

00:23:18.360 --> 00:23:19.330
Poof!

00:23:20.120 --> 00:23:23.080
Huh?! I turned into a fish?!

00:23:23.640 --> 00:23:27.050
Come to think of it, 
Asagao sucks at Transformation Jutsu.

00:23:24.240 --> 00:23:27.050
Glub! Glub! Glub!

00:23:30.360 --> 00:23:33.390
I sure wanted to see a man...

00:23:36.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Next time:

00:23:37.440 --> 00:23:38.540
To be continued!
